  "evidencia": "Page: Brett McClure. Sentence: Brett Dallas McClure (born February 19, 1981 in Yakima, Washington) is a retired American gymnast.\nPage: Brett McClure. Sentence: He won a bronze medal in the pommel horse at the 2001 Goodwill Games in Brisbane, Australia, and later helped his U.S. gymnastics team earn a silver in the team competition at the 2004 Summer Olympics in Athens.\nPage: 2001 Goodwill Games. Sentence: The competition was held in Brisbane, Queensland, Australia from 29 August to 9 September 2001.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Brett McClure. Sentence: Brett Dallas McClure (born February 19, 1981 in Yakima, Washington) is a retired American gymnast.\nPage: Brett McClure. Sentence: He won a bronze medal in the pommel horse at the 2001 Goodwill Games in Brisbane, Australia, and later helped his U.S. gymnastics team earn a silver in the team competition at the 2004 Summer Olympics in Athens.\nPage: 2001 Goodwill Games. Sentence: The competition was held in Brisbane, Queensland, Australia from 29 August to 9 September 2001.",
