        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brett McClure\n- Events: 2001 Goodwill Games, 2004 Summer Olympics\n- Places: Yakima, Washington, Brisbane, Queensland, Australia, Athens\n- Topics: American gymnastics\n\nFacts:\n- Brett McClure was born on February 19, 1981, in Yakima, Washington.\n- Brett McClure is a retired American gymnast.\n- The 2001 Goodwill Games were held in Brisbane, Queensland, Australia, from 29 August to 9 September 2001.\n- Brett McClure won a bronze medal in pommel horse at the 2001 Goodwill Games in Brisbane, Australia.\n- Brett McClure helped the United States gymnastics team win a silver medal in the team competition at the 2004 Summer Olympics in Athens.",
